0948}, {"text": "Through the unique ways they explore the possibility of enlightenment, composers allow us.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "\u201cto practise our own humanity\u2019.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.1320901320901321, "x1": 0.37362637362637363, "y1": 0.1452991452991453}, {"text": "How does this statement reflect your experience of studying Literary Mindscapes?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.1655011655011655, "x1": 0.7879120879120879, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "In your response, refer to TWO of your prescribed texts and at least ONE related text of your", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.1989121989121989, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.21212121212121213}, {"text": "\u2018own choosing.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.216006216006216, "x1": 0.23516483516483516, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction \u2014 William Faulkner, As I Lay Dying", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.2913752913752914, "x1": 0.5846153846153846, "y1": 0.3162393162393162}, {"text": "\u2014 Gail Jones, Sixty Lights", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.32323232323232326, "x1": 0.4989010989010989, "y1": 0.3356643356643357}, {"text": "\u2014 Katherine Mansfield, The Collected Stories", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.3457653457653458, "x1": 0.6604395604395604, "y1": 0.35742035742035744}, {"text": "* Prelude", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.3690753690753691, "x1": 0.3956043956043956, "y1": 0.3791763791763792}, {"text": "* Parle pas Francais", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.3853923853923854, "x1": 0.5373626373626373, "y1": 0.3986013986013986}, {"text": "* Bliss", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4024864024864025, "x1": 0.37142857142857144, "y1": 0.4125874125874126}, {"text": "* Psychology", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4188034188034188, "x1": 0.42527472527472526, "y1": 0.432012432012432}, {"text": "* The Daughters of the Late Colonel", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4358974358974359, "x1": 0.6153846153846154, "y1": 0.4491064491064491}, {"text": "+ Poetry \u2014 Emily Dickinson, The Complete Poems", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4693084693084693, "x1": 0.6285714285714286, "y1": 0.4825174825174825}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.4933954933954934, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.5058275058275058}, {"text": "1 felt a Funeral, in my Brain", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.515928515928516, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.5291375291375291}, {"text": "This is my letter to the World", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.5322455322455323, "x1": 0.5714285714285714, "y1": 0.5431235431235432}, {"text": "I died for Beauty \u2014 but was scarce", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.5462315462315462, "x1": 0.6120879120879121, "y1": 0.5656565656565656}, {"text": "Thad been hungry, all the Years", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.5656565656565656, "x1": 0.5945054945054945, "y1": 0.5788655788655789}, {"text": "Because I could not stop for Death", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.5827505827505828, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.5959595959595959}, {"text": "My Life had stood \u2014 a Loaded Gun", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.5990675990675991, "x1": 0.6175824175824176, "y1": 0.6122766122766122}, {"text": "A word dropped careless on a Page", "x0": 0.33186813186813185, "y0": 0.6161616161616161, "x1": 0.6241758241758242, "y1": 0.6293706293706294}, {"text": "+ Drama \u2014 William Shakespeare, Hamlet", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6495726495726496, "x1": 0.5516483516483517, "y1": 0.6627816627816627}, {"text": "+ Film Sofia Coppola, Lost in Translation", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.682983682983683, "x1": 0.5912087912087912, "y1": 0.6961926961926962}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4846153846153846, "y0": 0.7249417249417249, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.7350427350427351}], [{"text": "Question 2 (e) \u2014 Elective 5: Intersecting Worlds (25 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.6318681318681318, "y1": 0.0947940947940948}, {"text": "Through the unique ways they explore the possibilities of renewal, composers allow us \u2018to", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "practise our own humanity\u2019.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.1320901320901321, "x1": 0.34615384615384615, "y1": 0.1452991452991453}, {"text": "How does this statement reflect your experience of studying Intersecting Worlds?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.1655011655011655, "x1": 0.7813186813186813, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "In your response, refer to TWO of your prescribed texts and at least ONE related text of your", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.1989121989121989, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.21212121212121213}, {"text": "own choosing.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.216006216006216, "x1": 0.23516483516483516, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction \u2014 Melissa Harrison, Clay", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.29836829836829837, "x1": 0.4956043956043956, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "\u2014 Alex Miller, Journey to the Stone Country", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.32245532245532244, "x1": 0.6527472527472528, "y1": 0.3356643356643357}, {"text": "\u2014 Annie Proulx, The Shipping News", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.3457653457653458, "x1": 0.5846153846153846, "y1": 0.358974358974359}, {"text": "* Nonfiction \u2014 Tim Winton, Island Home", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3791763791763792, "x1": 0.5230769230769231, "y1": 0.39083139083139085}, {"text": "+ Poetry \u2014 William Wordsworth, Wil